              "id": "3f81574619fb36e7e7209fdc5fc4e48f884fcf2c",
              "message": "Add trax, a third register built on a chromatic ground (#21)\n\n* Add trax, a third register whose depth model is the printing press\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n* Give trax a contour ground and invert its surface ramp\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n* Stamp trax's structure and give tone a geometry channel\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n* Narrow trax to four hues and calm its ground\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n* Stamp trax-dark's placard in the light ink\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n* Narrow trax-dark to one warm ramp and one alarm\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n* Move trax-dark onto a chromatic ground\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n* Stop a nested Panel header inheriting the plate's control ink\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
